    "2:ב": "There",
    "3:א": "There",
    "3:ב": "Rambam in chapter 23",
    "3:ג": "There in the gemara",
    "3:ד": "There, as Chizkiyah in the name of Abaye",
    "4:_": "Terumat HaDeshen and in the name of Or Zarua, and likewise they wrote in his name in Hagahot chapter 2, and he brings proof from the Yerushalmi",
    "5:_": "Shibulei HaLeket in the name of the Geonim",
    "6:_": "Tur in the name of Rav R' Shimon",
    "7:_": "Shabbos 148 like Rava — Ri'f, Rosh, and Rambam in chapter 21 of the Laws of Shabbos",
    "8:_": "Likewise there, in the name of the Tosefta",
